== landing
Rain on the river. A lantern on a post, and a boat tied up under it.
A BOY: Ferry! Last ferry over!
OTTO: She heard you the first time.
ADA: I go when the rain eases. Not before.
* 1 How much to cross?
* 2 When will it ease?
* 3 Look at the river.
* 4 Sit with Otto.
* 5 Go home.
> 1
ADA: Two coins. Same as always.
* 1 When will it ease?
* 2 Look at the river.
* 3 Sit with Otto.
* 4 Go home.
> 2
Black water, moving fast under the rain.
* 1 When will it ease?
* 2 Look at the river.
* 3 Sit with Otto.
* 4 Go home.
> 2
Black water, moving fast under the rain.
* 1 When will it ease?
